### Create policy request
POST http://localhost:8000/api/policy-requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "client_request_id": "AGT-2026-0001",
  "agent_id": "AGENT-17",
  "customer_name": "Sample Customer",
  "date_of_birth": "1998-04-10",
  "destination": "INTERNATIONAL",
  "trip_start": "2026-11-10",
  "trip_end": "2026-11-14",
  "plan_code": "PLUS",
  "sum_insured": 300000
}

### Repeat same request
POST http://localhost:8000/api/policy-requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "client_request_id": "AGT-2026-0001",
  "agent_id": "AGENT-17",
  "customer_name": "Sample Customer",
  "date_of_birth": "1998-04-10",
  "destination": "INTERNATIONAL",
  "trip_start": "2026-11-10",
  "trip_end": "2026-11-14",
  "plan_code": "PLUS",
  "sum_insured": 300000
}

### List policy requests
GET http://localhost:8000/api/policy-requests?page=1&status=VALIDATED

### Show detail
GET http://localhost:8000/api/policy-requests/<public_request_id>

### Submit to mock insurer
POST http://localhost:8000/api/policy-requests/<public_request_id>/submit

### Set mock insurer scenario
POST http://localhost:8000/api/mock-insurer/scenario
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scenario": "timeout_after_issue"
}

### Reconcile timed-out issuance
POST http://localhost:8000/api/mock-insurer/reconcile
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider_reference": "REF-ABCD1234"
}

### Send callback
POST http://localhost:8000/api/mock-insurer/callback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider_reference": "REF-ABCD1234",
  "event_id": "EV-1234",
  "policy_number": "POL-1234"
}

### Validation failure
POST http://localhost:8000/api/policy-requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "client_request_id": "AGT-2026-0002",
  "agent_id": "AGENT-17",
  "customer_name": "Bad Input",
  "date_of_birth": "2099-01-01",
  "destination": "EUROPE",
  "trip_start": "2026-11-10",
  "trip_end": "2026-11-09",
  "plan_code": "GOLD",
  "sum_insured": 200000
}
